        "# qualified name\n",
        "\n",
        "A dotted name showing where a class, function, or method was defined within its module, available as `__qualname__`. Nested function names include `<locals>`.\n",
        "\n",
        "[Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-qualified-name)"
